## 7. Success Metrics

**Leading (days–weeks after Phase 1 ships)**
- 0 unintended diffs across 3 consecutive bootstrap runs on a clean test VM (idempotency, P0.4)
- 100% of automated commits pass the secret scan with 0 false negatives against a seeded test secret (P0.6)
- CI workflow count with overlapping triggers goes from 2 (`ci.yml` + `validate.yml`) to 0 (P0.5)

**Lagging (weeks–months)**
- 0 incidents of secrets or unintended machine noise entering git history over the following quarter
- New-machine onboarding time (bootstrap → fully configured) stays flat or improves as machine count grows

